//            the previous CHANGE note change with each version.
// CHANGE 0.1.8: Independent check of v0.1.7 (RUN_RECORD 9B4AD065…0881): CHECK_FORM no NO; one NOT_SAME: CHANGE 0.1.7 did
//            not say that v0.1.7 re-wrapped the lines of FOR_WHAT(MUST_LET), nor that in the R_RECORD reading the comma
//            after "(R272 L16, L19)" became a semicolon and the last sentence was re-wrapped. Every change of this version,
//            in file order; no line is re-wrapped, and each changed line is changed only by the words quoted:
//            (1) VERSION; SUPERSEDES names v0.1.7 (its three lines); this note; the label of CHANGE 0.1.7;
//            (2) the held list names PRIOR_v0.1.7.mal and PRIOR_RUN_RECORD_V017.md in place of the v0.1.6 names;
