//            (5) R_ENVELOPE: "names all its incident junctions with" became "names all its incident junctions and no other, with";
//            (6) REQUIRED: "executed on its two columns." became "executed on its two columns and reading IF_THEN.".
//            The seed's cells are the same 31; the terminal, the encoding block and every vector do not change.
// CHANGE 0.1.7 (unpromoted): Independent check of v0.1.6 (RUN_RECORD C58068C3…426D): CHECK_FORM no NO; one NOT_SAME: CHANGE 0.1.6 did
//            not name four additions of v0.1.6: REQUIRED gained "on the bound card" and "it stays MAYBE until a bound clause
//            carries it, and this obligation stays PENDING with it"; the R_SHED_CLASS reading gained its last sentence ("The
//            comparison reads ASSIGN events … is this restriction."); WHAT(NO) gained "at least one". Every change of this
