//            (1) VERSION; SUPERSEDES names v0.1.6; this note; the label of CHANGE 0.1.6;
//            (2) ORIGIN: "(R268 L7–L8)" became "(R268 L7–L8, its first two sentences)";
//            (3) the held list names PRIOR_v0.1.6.mal and PRIOR_RUN_RECORD_V016.md in place of the v0.1.5 names;
